{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/09/4911932/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は服作りは好きだけど\n単調作業の編み物は苦手で...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想のマフラーが見つからず、\n編み物が趣味の母に\n毛糸を渡して編んでもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/09/4911932/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はこれで\n寒さ乗り越えられそう(*'ω'*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Fm yokohama内で放送されます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"神奈川日産 NOTE e-POWER\nX'mas DAYS という期間限定のコーナーを\n担当させていただくことになりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/25までの期間中、\nNOTE e-POWERに乗って\n神奈川県のスポットをご紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チェルシーリナさん、増田美香さん、\n高島英里奈さんとともに4人で\n交代制でリポートします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(月)～(金) 10:40～/16:23～\n(土) 10:40～/16:41～\n(日) 11:00～/15:16～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとやりたかったラジオレギュラー\n期間限定のコーナーといえども\nとってもとっても嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも小さい頃からいつも聞いていた\nFMヨコハマさんで出来るのが\n更に嬉しいです(*⁰▿⁰*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/09/4911932/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の初登場回はいつかな？(*⁰▿⁰*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみに待っていてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16枚目シングル個別握手券が\n全完売しました～～(*⁰▿⁰*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーいわーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少し少ない部数での完売は\n前にあったけど、\n私の中では今までで1番の記録です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様に支えていただいているんだと\n改めて感じました！\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の握手会ではサンタさんで\nお待ちしておりますヾ(ω`　)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のアンダーライブの初めての挑戦。\nドキドキ。緊張するなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しみで仕方がないよ！！！\n音楽って素敵だよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2016/12/09/4911932/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなすきだよーーーー！(*⁰▿⁰*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}